A **homologous series** is a family of related carbon compounds that:
**1.** have the same **general formula**;
**2.** show **similar chemical properties**;
**3.** show a **gradation in their physical properties**;
**4.** differ by a **CH₂** group from one member to the next.
All four points are marking points, and the fourth is the one most answers miss.
